{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Flow step debugger (P3, lifecycle R4): timer target (every 5 minutes, the control's reap timer). Ends IDLE debug sessions with no debug_* call and no step for 30 minutes (tombstoned, so a later stop/state answers ended_by reap). Never unlinks a session that has an owner: a running continue refreshes its heartbeat every step, so it stays alive without HTTP polls; an owner whose heartbeat is older than 2 hours (one op executing that long) is ASKED to stop (phase stopping) and ends itself at its next step boundary - the op in flight completes and is recorded once. Returns {status, removed: [ids], stopping: [ids], kept, workers (live continue threads), ended (tombstones)}. Admin-only.","import":"use ndata::dataobject::DataObject;","params":[],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"xuyiro1a16a466259h99","readers":[],"time":1793450859583,"username":"system","writers":[]}